	(text "External PSU assumption envelope: roughly +/-12.5 V valley to +/-20.6 V peak.\nFinal transformer and capacitors not fixed. Recalculate and measure before use.\nSchematic connected and ERC checked separately from electrical/model/thermal validation.\nThe original empty PCB is retained. Layout is for the user; no routing supplied."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 242.57 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "71d3eca6-41fc-57d9-93b9-3fb60634ae9c")
	)
	(text "Assembly gates\n1. Fit bias short J101/J201; leave R114/R214 unfitted; trimmers at MAXIMUM resistance.\n2. Verify live tab insulation and Q108/Q208 thermal contact.\n3. Connect supply GND to the junction of the two series bench outputs.\n4. Connect oscilloscope earth clips to board GND only.\n5. Use dummy loads; no speakers until DC protection and warm-up tests pass."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 185.42 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.2 1.2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b1815621-cea8-5883-a440-26406e518354")
	)
