	(text "REV 0.2: SIMULATION DEVELOPMENT / NOT FABRICATION RELEASED\n8 ohm prototype; external current-limited +/-12 to +/-15 V first.\nNo mains circuitry. External DC speaker protection required. Read README and bench procedure.\nBIAS: fixed-ratio sensor + programmed offset; MOSFET VGS slope and SOA still need measurement."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
